<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms buy 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms buy 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Philippine firms bought 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for March shipment, Manila grain traders said on Friday.</p>
